# NetHubKe monorepo — see package-specific examples:
#   apps/backend/.env.example
#   apps/frontend/.env.example
#
# Typical local ports:
#   Frontend  http://localhost:3000
#   Backend   http://localhost:8000
#   Postgres  localhost:5432
#   Keycloak  per your IdP host
#   Redis     localhost:6379 (required from N2 onward for AS caches)
